    "html": "<h1 id=\"template-migrations\">Template Migrations</h1>\n<p>Store migration notes for KBs that were created from older template versions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"naming-convention\">Naming Convention</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>migrate-v1.0.0-to-v1.1.0.md</li>\n<li>migrate-v1.1.0-to-v2.0.0.md</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"what-a-migration-note-should-contain\">What A Migration Note Should Contain</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>what changed</li>\n<li>why it changed</li>\n<li>which files must be updated</li>\n<li>whether prompt patch is required</li>\n<li>rollback or fallback guidance</li>\n<li>post-migration checklist</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"current-baseline\">Current Baseline</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Current baseline version: v1.1.0</li>\n<li>Previous baseline version: v1.0.0</li>\n<li>Current migration note: <a href=\"migrate-v1.0.0-to-v1.1.0.md\">migrate-v1.0.0-to-v1.1.0.md</a></li>\n</ul>",
