    "html": "<h1 id=\"intent-int-2-3-2-notes-migration-closeout\">Intent: INT-2-3-2-notes-migration-closeout</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<p>Supporting governance intent for <code>v2-3-2-closure-pass</code>. Scope is limited to the remaining notes classification and migration work required to start <code>v2.4</code> with clean intent ownership. No package behavior change is allowed under this intent.</p>\n<h2 id=\"plan\">Plan</h2>\n<p>&gt; See <code>plan.md</code> for full details.</p>\n<h2 id=\"impact\">Impact</h2>\n<p>&gt; See <code>impact.md</code> for full details.</p>\n<h2 id=\"staged-files\">Staged Files</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>proposed-changes/knowledge-base/intents/_active/INT-2-3-2-notes-migration-closeout/plan.md</code> (this intent plan)</li>\n<li><code>proposed-changes/knowledge-base/intents/_active/INT-2-3-2-notes-migration-closeout/impact.md</code> (this intent impact)</li>\n</ul>",
