    "html": "<h1 id=\"impact\">Impact</h1>\n<h2 id=\"affected-areas\">Affected Areas</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>src/commands/chaos.js</code> — <code>deriveChaosContextSignals()</code>, subtractive formula, output rendering</li>\n<li>Formula string: <code>subtractive-v1</code> → <code>subtractive-v2</code> (output-only, no schema change)</li>\n<li><code>template/12-ai-skills/agent-operating-manual.md</code> — document cognitive drift signal definitions</li>\n<li>Runtime: reads <code>.kb/pulse-log.jsonl</code> if present (created by v2.3.3)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"breaking-change\">Breaking Change</h2>\n<p>No. Additive signals only. Cognitive reduction is capped at 15 points and cannot increase score beyond 100.</p>\n<h2 id=\"downstream-risk\">Downstream Risk</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Low: existing chaos score may decrease slightly on projects with many ungrounded intents — expected behavior.</li>\n<li>Medium: if pulse-log format (v2.3.3) changes before v2.3.4 ships, <code>agreement-density</code> computation needs update.</li>\n<li>Mitigation: graceful degrade path ensures zero cognitive score when pulse-log is absent.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"versioning-decision\">Versioning Decision</h2>\n<p>Owned by v2.3.4. Formula bumped to <code>subtractive-v2</code>. No CLI signature change.</p>",
    "fromCache": true,
