    "html": "<h1 id=\"changelog\">Changelog</h1>\n<p>Extracted from: HEAD~4..HEAD</p>\n<h2 id=\"commits\">Commits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>6274b6e feat(self-host): initialize tracked KB runtime profile for this repository (Layer D)</li>\n<li>4d7f513 feat(kb-root): promote maintainer agent files from .local/kb-agent to top-level kb-root (Layer C)</li>\n<li>56d538f chore(repo): rewrite .gitignore for self-host profile and clean root reports</li>\n<li>e69bee4 docs(kb): codify three-layer KB model and refactor program for v2.3.x</li>\n</ul>",
