    "html": "<h1 id=\"plan\">Plan</h1>\n<h2 id=\"goal\">Goal</h2>\n<p>Move v2.5 roadmap planning from notes to this intent workspace and keep future updates intent-first.</p>\n<h2 id=\"files-touched\">Files Touched</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Source roadmap note:</li>\n<p>\t- <code>notes/upgrade-v2.5-cross-project-foundation-plan.md</code></p>\n<li>Intent workspace files:</li>\n<p>\t- <code>knowledge-base/intents/_active/v2-5-cross-project-foundation/intent.md</code> (updated) \t- <code>knowledge-base/intents/_active/v2-5-cross-project-foundation/plan.md</code> (updated) \t- <code>knowledge-base/intents/_active/v2-5-cross-project-foundation/impact.md</code> (updated)</p>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"acceptance-criteria\">Acceptance Criteria</h2>\n<p>1. v2.5 milestones and scope are documented in this intent. 2. Notes entry is treated as historical source only. 3. Migration intent references this workspace as the v2.5 owner.</p>",
