    "html": "<h1 id=\"impact\">Impact</h1>\n<h2 id=\"affected-areas\">Affected Areas</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>template/12-ai-skills/</code> — intent schema and agent operating manual docs</li>\n<li><code>template/.github/agents/</code> — KB Agent definition shipped to users</li>\n<li><code>svfactory/specifics.md</code> (new) — SV Factory-only overrides documented and isolated</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"breaking-change\">Breaking Change</h2>\n<p>No. Doc-only changes. No CLI, schema, or runtime behavior changes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"downstream-risk\">Downstream Risk</h2>\n<p>Low. Downstream users reading intent-lifecycle-schema.md will see better-framed defaults. No migration required.</p>\n<h2 id=\"impact-signals\">Impact Signals</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>doc-clarity</li>\n<li>kb-agent-first-design</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&gt; List observed or anticipated impact signals (e.g. drift, rework, user confusion).</p>",
