    "html": "<h1 id=\"gates-report\">Gates Report</h1>\n<p>&gt; Managed by KB Observer (v1.8+). Do not edit manually — regenerated by <code>kb status</code>. &gt; Detection-only in v1.8. Gates produce warnings only (no hard blocking).</p>\n<h2 id=\"last-run\">Last Run</h2>\n<pre><code>runAt: &lt;ISO timestamp>\noverallStatus: pass | warn</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"gate-results\">Gate Results</h2>\n<h3 id=\"debt-gate\">Debt Gate</h3>\n<pre><code>status: pass | warn\nevidence: []\nrecommendedAction: null | \"...\"</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"entropy-gate\">Entropy Gate</h3>\n<pre><code>status: pass | warn\nevidence: []\nrecommendedAction: null | \"...\"</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"lesson-contradiction-gate\">Lesson Contradiction Gate</h3>\n<pre><code>status: pass | warn\nevidence: []\nrecommendedAction: null | \"...\"</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"version-scope-gate\">Version Scope Gate</h3>\n<pre><code>status: pass | warn\nevidence: []\nrecommendedAction: null | \"...\"</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"reconstruction-triggers\">Reconstruction Triggers</h2>\n<pre><code>triggered: false\ntriggers: []\nrationale: \"\"</code></pre>\n<p>---</p>\n<p><em>See <code>debt-index.md</code>, <code>entropy-index.md</code>, <code>lessons-index.md</code>, and <code>decision-records.md</code> for source data.</em></p>",
