    "html": "<h1 id=\"lessons-index\">Lessons Index</h1>\n<p>&gt; Managed by KB Observer (v1.8+). Edit manually or via <code>kb observe</code> (future). &gt; Each item is a YAML block delimited by <code>---</code>. &gt; Lifecycle: proposed → accepted → enforced → measured → deprecated &gt; Enforcement: none | manual | gate | automated</p>\n<p>--- id: L-EXAMPLE status: proposed level: repo domain: governance source: D-EXAMPLE rule: Replace this with the codified learning rule applies_to: Replace with scope (e.g. all intents, release pipeline, specific command) linked_debt: D-EXAMPLE linked_entropy: null enforcement: none review_after: null ---</p>",
